        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage Commercial HL6 Hospital Latchset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Schlage Commercial HL6</b> Push / Pull Latches for installations where both versatility and durability are critical. Ideal for use on hospital and industrial doors, including fire doors, when hands free door open is required. Schlage Commercial has been providing the highest quality door hardware for 75 years.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in 2-3/4\", 3-3/4\" or 5\" backset. The short throw angle allows an easy push or pull action to open the door even when hands are not free.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Schlage Commercial  HL6 can be mounted in any of six different positions:\r\n<li>Both handles down</li>\r\n<li>Both handles up</li>\r\n<li>One handle down and one handle up (either push or pull side of door)</li>\r\n<li>Both handles point away from latch</li>\r\n<li>Both handles point toward latch</li>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Schlage HL6 Push / Pull Latch:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Non Handed</li>\r\n<li>No Fused Link to Fail</li>\r\n<li>UL Listed for all labeled metal and wood doors</li>\r\n<li>Variable mounting positions</li>\r\n<li>Function: Passage</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-5/8\" Maximum</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-9/16\" Maximum</li>\r\n<li>Body Height: 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Push/Pull Handle Height: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li> Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/HL6.pdf?v=1704262191\" target=\"new\"><b>Schlage HL6 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/HL6-install.pdf?v=1704262192\" target=\"new\"><b>Schlage HL6 Installation (PDF)</b></a> </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
